# docs/ is rendered by `just docs` / CI (shipyard build-docs); only the
# hand-authored sources negated below are tracked. An enumerated list of
# generated filenames drifts every time shipyard adds one, so this ignores the
# directory and allowlists the exceptions instead.
docs/*
!docs/README.md
!docs/_sidebar.md
!docs/favicon.svg
__pycache__
.DS_Store
.playwright-mcp/
